* LTC4281 Hot-Swap Controller Simulation

* Input Voltage Source (12V with 1ms startup to simulate hot-plug)
VIN IN 0 PWL(0 0 1m 12)

* Sense Resistor (2mOhm for 12.5A current limit)
R_sense IN N_SENSE_MINUS 0.002

* Pass MOSFET
M1 N_SENSE_MINUS GATE OUT N_MOS
.model N_MOS VDMOS(Rg=2 Vto=2.5 Rd=5m Rs=1m Rb=5m Kp=60 Cgdmax=2n Cgdmin=1n Cgs=2n Cjo=2n Is=10p mfg=Generic Vds=40 Ron=10m Qg=30n)

* LTC4281 Hot Swap Controller Instance
* Pins: VDD SENSE+ SENSE- GATE SOURCE OUT FB PROFIL ON TIMER INTVCC FAULTB PG EEB GND ADIN SDAI SDAO SCL ALERTB GPIO1 GPIO2 GPIO3 VDD33 WP A0 A1 A2
X1 IN IN N_SENSE_MINUS GATE OUT OUT N_FB 0 N_ON N_TIMER N_INTVCC N_FAULTB N_PG 0 0 0 N_SDAI N_SDAO N_SCL N_ALERTB N_GPIO1 N_GPIO2 N_GPIO3 N_VDD33 0 0 0 0 LTC4281

* Timing and Bypass Capacitors
C_TIMER N_TIMER 0 0.1u
C_INTVCC N_INTVCC 0 1u
C_VDD33 N_VDD33 0 1u

* ON Pin Divider (Sets UVLO to ~10.5V)
R_ON1 IN N_ON 100k
R_ON2 N_ON 0 13k

* FB Pin Divider (Sets Power Good / Foldback threshold to ~10.5V)
R_FB1 OUT N_FB 100k
R_FB2 N_FB 0 13k

* Pull-up Resistors for Open-Drain Outputs to INTVCC
R_PU_FAULT N_INTVCC N_FAULTB 100k
R_PU_PG N_INTVCC N_PG 100k
R_PU_ALERT N_INTVCC N_ALERTB 100k
R_PU_SDAI N_INTVCC N_SDAI 100k
R_PU_SDAO N_INTVCC N_SDAO 100k
R_PU_SCL N_INTVCC N_SCL 100k
R_PU_GPIO1 N_INTVCC N_GPIO1 100k
R_PU_GPIO2 N_INTVCC N_GPIO2 100k
R_PU_GPIO3 N_INTVCC N_GPIO3 100k

* Load (12 Ohm resistive load + 1000uF bulk capacitance for inrush)
R_LOAD OUT 0 12
C_LOAD OUT 0 1000u

* Transient Analysis (500ms to allow for internal ~100ms debounce and inrush settling)
.tran 0 500m

.end
